sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor User
    participant Phone as Mobile Phone
    participant Browser as Next.js Client<br/>(Browser)
    participant Firebase as Firebase Auth
    participant ServerAction as Next.js<br/>Server Action
    participant GoServer as Go API Server
    participant RecaptchaV3 as reCAPTCHA v3
    participant Hub as ACM Hub Cluster
    participant Keycloak as Keycloak SSO
    participant MaaS as MaaS API
    participant Spoke as Spoke Cluster

    note over User,Spoke: Phase 1 — Background Provisioning (Cluster Claimer + Authenticator)

    rect rgb(240, 230, 255)
        Hub->>Hub: ClusterPool provisions ClusterDeployments
        note right of Hub: Hive creates clusters<br/>from pool template

        loop Watch ClusterDeployments
            GoServer-->>Hub: Cluster Claimer watches for Provisioned=True
            GoServer->>Hub: Create ClusterClaims (prelude1, prelude2, ...)
            note right of GoServer: Up to cluster-claim-limit<br/>Dynamic scaling when<br/>available ≤ threshold
        end

        loop Watch ClusterClaims (bound)
            GoServer-->>Hub: Cluster Authenticator watches for bound claims
            GoServer->>Spoke: Wait for stable cluster<br/>(ClusterOperators + certs ready)
            GoServer->>Spoke: Generate system:admin kubeconfig (CSR flow)
            GoServer->>Hub: Update admin kubeconfig secret
            GoServer->>Spoke: Generate admin user kubeconfig (CSR flow)
            GoServer->>Hub: Create/update user kubeconfig secret
            GoServer->>Spoke: Create prelude ConfigMap
            GoServer->>Keycloak: Create KeycloakRealmImport for cluster
            GoServer->>Hub: Label ClusterClaim prelude-auth=done
            note right of GoServer: Cluster now eligible<br/>for user assignment
        end

        loop Every 10 minutes
            GoServer->>Spoke: Check CSR signer expiry
            alt Signer rolled (expiry > 25 days)
                GoServer->>Spoke: Regenerate kubeconfigs if client cert < 1 day
                GoServer->>Hub: Update kubeconfig secrets
            end
        end
    end

    note over User,Spoke: Phase 2 — User Claims a Cluster

    rect rgb(232, 245, 233)
        User->>Browser: Enter phone number + admin password
        Browser->>Firebase: signInWithPhoneNumber()
        Firebase->>Phone: Send SMS verification code
        Phone->>User: Receive SMS
        User->>Browser: Enter 6-digit code
        Browser->>Firebase: confirm(code)
        Firebase-->>Browser: Phone verified ✓

        Browser->>Browser: Generate browser fingerprint<br/>(SHA-256 of canvas, screen, etc.)
        Browser->>RecaptchaV3: Execute reCAPTCHA v3
        RecaptchaV3-->>Browser: Token

        Browser->>ServerAction: claimCluster(phone, password,<br/>fingerprint, recaptchaToken)
        ServerAction->>GoServer: POST /api/claim

        GoServer->>RecaptchaV3: Verify token (score ≥ 0.5)
        RecaptchaV3-->>GoServer: Score OK ✓

        GoServer->>Hub: Check fingerprint on existing ClusterClaims
        alt Fingerprint already used with different phone
            GoServer-->>Browser: 403 device_already_claimed
        end

        GoServer->>Hub: Find ClusterClaims with<br/>prelude-auth=done

        alt Phone matches existing claim
            GoServer->>Hub: Get ClusterDeployment
        else No match — assign new cluster
            GoServer->>Hub: Label ClusterClaim<br/>prelude=<phone>
            GoServer->>Hub: Label ClusterClaim<br/>prelude-fp=<fingerprint>
            GoServer->>Hub: Set spec.lifetime<br/>(age + cluster-lifetime)
        end

        GoServer->>Hub: Get ClusterDeployment<br/>(webConsoleURL)
        GoServer->>Hub: Read admin + user<br/>kubeconfig secrets

        GoServer->>Keycloak: Get master realm token
        GoServer->>Keycloak: Set admin user password<br/>on cluster realm

        opt MaaS configured
            GoServer->>MaaS: POST /tokens (with expiry)
            MaaS-->>GoServer: Token
            GoServer->>MaaS: GET /models
            MaaS-->>GoServer: Model URLs
            GoServer->>Spoke: Update chat ConfigMap<br/>(OPENAI_API_BASE_URLS)
            GoServer->>Spoke: Update chat Secret<br/>(OPENAI_API_KEYS)
            GoServer->>Spoke: Update multimodal-chatbot<br/>Secret (config.json)
            GoServer->>Spoke: Restart chat pods
        end

        GoServer-->>ServerAction: Console URL + AI URL +<br/>Kubeconfig + expiresAt
        ServerAction-->>Browser: Cluster credentials

        Browser->>User: Display Web Console URL<br/>AI Gateway URL<br/>Kubeconfig download<br/>Expiry countdown
    end
